# Giant spider: idle 0-11, walk 16-31, attack 48-59, death 80-89 off a 16-wide sheet; rear-up and recovery rows left unimported.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet spider.ppm
cell 96 96

bank SPIDER
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : lin 0-11
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : lin 16-31
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : lin 48-59
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : lin 80-89
